<title>USA: Xerox Corp Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Xerox Corp Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.78		    $0.68</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 0.75		     0.65</p>
<p> Net			270,000		  237,000</p>
<p> Revs		   4,022,000		3,928,000</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Common shares used to calculate fully diluted EPS were 361.7 million vs 363.9 million.</p>
<p>Common shares used to calculate primary EPS were 331.5 million vs 333.0 million.</p>
<p>First Call consensus estimate for Q1 was $0.70 a share.</p>
</text>
